# Project invariants

- Never commit secrets. Use `wrangler secret put` or `.dev.vars` (gitignored) for `LOGIN_USERNAME` and `LOGIN_PASSWORD`.
- Do not log cookie headers, passwords, or full upstream request/response bodies in production code paths.
- Upstream Routeware session cookies live only in the `AuthSession` Durable Object; public API clients are unauthenticated.
- Prefer explicit `/api/v1/...` routes with fixed upstream URL templates over echoing arbitrary client path segments toward `/WebRW`.
